Subject: [PATCH 1/9] feat: add per-activity auto-execution switches (nas
 patch)

Reintroduce activity automation switches (removed in the TS rewrite vs
BuildAtDawn upstream) behind new automation keys, default off:

- activity_battle_pass_claim: claim stellar/battle pass rewards
- activity_charity_claim: charity red flower seeds/daily gift/progress
- activity_charity_donate: donate all love balance
- activity_qingmei_claim: claim daily qingmei seeds
- activity_qingmei_brew: auto brew/continue/settle qingmei wine
- activity_milk_tea_fund_claim: claim milk tea growth fund rewards

New service core/src/services/activity-auto.ts runs every 30 minutes via
the worker scheduler (exclusive automation lock), treats unavailable /
already-claimed / not-open errors as quiet no-ops, caps real error
retries at 3/day, and reports successes via push_notify. Web panel gains
an activity automation section in AutomationSettingsForm.
